_kwDOAO6SJc6r7roM","user":{"login":"JamesMowery","id":868178,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODE3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/868178?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesMowery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T17:20:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T17:23:30Z","body":"I submitted an out of date notice for libdecor to Arch Linux's maintainer, and they got libdecor updated either yesterday or today. I just tested it out and it looks like we're in business!\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07683c3b-1934-497c-9eec-8e5f2363ab8a)\n\nThanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884549132/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884568678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105155#issuecomment-2884568678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105155","id":2884568678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r7wZm","user":{"login":"JamesMowery","id":868178,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODE3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/868178?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesMowery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JamesMowery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T17:29:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T17:40:35Z","body":"Unfortunately, it looks like we might have other issues (unclear if this was an issue prior to updating libdecor).\n\nWhen interacting with a dialog (at least from the project selection screen), the pop up windows look scaled incorrectly) as follows:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbfb1805-4b5c-4039-96a4-2f947d6c5c71)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfd75367-0b5f-46dd-8425-dde11f266f3a)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0e15fb2-3a53-488d-b475-c96a9e742563)\n\nThe moment you move your mouse or do any interaction, it immediately fixes itself, but the initial view is always off. Knowing my horrors with HiDPI displays on Linux in the past (thankfully it's gotten a lot better with Wayland), it looks like it's incorrectly scaling the contents the moment the dialog is displayed, and then the moment after any interaction happens, it fixes itself.\n\nThankfully, this seems to be limited to only the project selection screen. I tried clicking around a few different preference popups and whatnot in the engine itself, and everything appeared fine.\n\nVideo of it happening. Very odd. Seems to fix itself when hovering over any corner where the resize cursor shows up:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b90137b-91c3-43de-a44a-a5944362e6fb\n\nIssue is on 4.5 dev 4. Version 4 stable does not show this issue however.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884568678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884759321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105155#issuecomment-2884759321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105155","id":2884759321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r8e8Z","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T18:44:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T18:44:16Z","body":"Mhhh, that's weird indeed. Since it's a different issue, I'd appreciate if you could open a new ticket and attach the output of the following command:\n\n```\nWAYLAND_DEBUG=1 path_to_godot_executable --verbose 2>&1 | tee wayland.log\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884759321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4366825273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105155#issuecomment-4366825273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105155","id":4366825273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBEh3OQ","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-03T18:09:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T18:09:38Z","body":"Closing, as it's been quite a while since libdecor released this fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://a